/** Atmakaraka themes per navamsha (Jaimini teaching from the lectures). */
export const ATMAKARAKA_IN_NAVAMSHA: Record<Rashi, string> = {
  1: 'The soul starts from zero again and again, and pays a price before any success. Patience is the missing quality (Saturn is debilitated here); crises are met by fighting, not by waiting. Leadership is the gift (Sun is exalted): act, do not freeze.',
  2: 'Resources, food, vehicles and comfort come easily — the soul came to receive, protect and share. It turns fierce only when family wealth is snatched. Speech, food and respect keep the store open.',
  3: 'The soul is trained by reaction, not by a fresh start. Company, hearing and daily habit program it. Sadhana keeps the mouth clean; without it the same mind only answers other people.',
  4: 'The soul came to absorb, to mother, and to serve the many. Company writes the heart. Healing is possible here, and only after the toxic room is left.',
  5: 'The soul must burn before the chair. Do not become the servant of a powerful person. Company of a king dazzles, and pride can hide right from wrong. Keep a counsellor, and credit the fame to previous merit.',
  6: 'The soul is a process, not a throne. Atmakaraka in Virgo navamsha learns by repeating, labelling and correcting. Joy and beauty stay thin — Venus is debilitated — until the daily work is actually done. Out of the box is not this placement. Precision is.',
  7: 'The soul wants heaven: partnership, money, beauty and a name. Atmakaraka in Libra navamsha learns through the other person. Loyalty keeps the wealth. Ego, haste and a second bond empty the account. Saturn is exalted — patience and profit sense are the gift — and the Sun is debilitated, so father and raw authority stay thin until earned through partnership.',
  8: 'Mother\'s milk is missing — emotional nourishment is scarce. Atmakaraka in Scorpio navamsha transforms through what it fears. The soul is fried until love of bhoga dies. Forgive, forget, move on. Moon is debilitated here: comfort will not come from the expected place. The exit is a guru who has walked the same fire — Sagittarius after the pit.',
  9: 'The soul sits on the ridge of bhagya. Atmakaraka in Sagittarius navamsha must keep morals very high — one slip costs the position (Nahusha). Faith, long vision and the guru are the gifts; ego and matsarya of fire are the test. Mute action and charity refill fortune; shady bonds drain it into Capricorn bondage.',
  10: 'The soul serves what it over-used. Atmakaraka in Capricorn navamsha is bonded labour until karma burns. Jupiter is debilitated — happiness, children\'s ease and soft wisdom feel scarce. Mars-like drive and execution are the gift; release control through work and a little bhakti (Pisces exit). Do not play victim.',
  11: 'The soul carries past-life punya — credit points that bypass procedure. Atmakaraka in Aquarius navamsha gets desires fulfilled through networks, back-doors and irregular chunks, but only if unresolved grief is released and the merit is not spent as obsession, EMI and anti-authority theatre. Refill the bank with social service; Leo is the controller.',
  12: 'The soul came to stand alone with God and nature as the only support. Atmakaraka in Pisces navamsha must give to the universe, release past and false bonds, and accept isolation as training — Mercury is debilitated (mind calculation fails), Venus is exalted (devotion). Pending karma and grandmother\'s account decide whether moksha tastes sweet or sleepless. Fire signs never produce this navamsha.',
}

