    essence:
      'Pisces navamsha frees from karma-bandhan when pending debt is clear and punya is real — otherwise it is sleepless moksha. Eighth from Leo it drops the throne (resignation, long leave, transfer, sabbatical, terminate). Venus is exalted as devotion (not D9 marriage-business); Mercury is debilitated — the mind does not calculate. After Aquarius spent the punya bank, the return journey begins: false material bonds, fraud and duplicity dissolve in its dasha. Fourth from Sagittarius: garbhagriha, the galaxy, rain of grace, subconscious cleanliness. Tenth from Gemini: sadhana\'s end — Krishna day and night in the mind-temple. Ninth from Cancer: lost in Krishna bhakti; for Rama it is vanvas leave from the seat. Sixth from Libra: Lakshmi sulks until surrender. Eleventh from Taurus: desire fulfilment through katha, dan and punya (baniya logic). Nightmare for fire — Aries, Leo and Sagittarius never produce Pisces navamsha. Any planet here stands you on your own feet with God/nature holding from behind; company leaves so no intermediary remains. Twelfth-house planets in D9 do the same — divorce when you depended on that person. No routine; past overthinking; the dan navamsha: what you gave the world returns. Grandmother\'s punya, feet, terrace, bedroom, independent work, and the inner state in meditation all sit here. Cancer–Scorpio–Pisces absorb when clear; malefics mean debt, daivic disaster and insomnia for sleep you once broke.',
