      Ma: 'Aerospace, airports, flights, ships, aircraft design, import-export, pipelines, cables, payment gateways across countries, hospital mechanical gear, turbulence/bridges, tower red lights, hot-air balloons. Sibling abroad, dead or out of contact; friends/groups/elder cousins distant. Alone with no path: Bajrangbali first (training strength); Narasimha after purification (ugra). Donate land, vehicle, blood and body-service to God. Focus fails → sit and meditate. Night gym/running for sleep; dreams of Hanuman, mountains, Devi. Remote jungle Hanuman temples with deepam. Works on the bed with laptop; bed fights. BSF, air force, coastal, fighter/watch-tower, ocean engineer, anti-drone significators.',
