      4: 'From Cancer — destined to leave home; natural abroad settlement. Social service (food, pyau, hospitals) becomes dharma/bhandara. Ninth-from teaching of morals — harsh dasha. Leave those loved most (Sati leaving father\'s sabha). Saturn ensures hell from the trusted. Fear of dying in water or alone in a dark house; learn to swim. Aquarium dead-fish significators; personality change after beloved\'s death; tarpana essential.',
