      7: 'From Libra — strongest divorce signature: frees what would not leave. Foreign after marriage; losses and partner deceit when weak. Scary dreams (abuse themes — clinical). Dream-spouse fantasies (Sun weak in both). Good planets liberate after marriage; weak planets bring fraud bonds. Relationship→bedroom; shows personal spaces to visitors. Maternal-side secrets.',
      8: 'From Scorpio — "I moved on" while still looping. Toxicity read as love; marries the one who stood in the landslide. Natural Brahmin/astrology; walk plus black coffee solves hard problems. Chemistry and Ayurveda. Small cramped Shaktipeeth garbhagriha. Burn/flush old photos. Addiction; gupta dan then regret.',
      9: 'From Sagittarius — this source does not produce Pisces navamsha.',
