/** Dasha-time reading per navamsha — what the period of a planet placed here tends to bring. */
export const NAVAMSHA_DASHA_NOTE: Record<Rashi, string> = {
  1: 'In this dasha a new beginning is forced on you and the fruit is unstable: courage, conflict, a price paid up front, and do-or-die moments. Fight rather than freeze. Burn the spare fire through sport or martial work. Blood, injuries and sudden breaks are the health watch.',
  2: 'In this dasha the planet delivers its own wealth — property, paper, stock, a shop, a marriage gift. The relative it signifies is the channel. Gossip, wasted food and harsh speech shut the store. Buy less than you want to hoard; what you sell must be replaced, because this navamsha never lets stock fall to zero.',
  3: 'In this dasha nothing is started fresh: you answer, copy, correct and defend. Medals, skills and a better surrounding can come, and so can gossip. A promise made here is reviewed again when a better option appears. Keep the hearing clean.',
  4: 'In this dasha the heart runs the result. Good company repairs it; a toxic room wounds it and can shut the work down. Feed people, sing, and bathe in living water. A rigid timetable will not hold. What is shown here is felt for life, so do not enter a bond you have not studied.',
  5: 'In this dasha the planet fights for the chair. Struggle, ego and a structural test come first. It overworks you until authority is actually delivered. A Sagittarius period inside Leo, or Leo inside Sagittarius, is the fall from a post and a change of company. Leo is the position. Sagittarius tests it and drops it.',
  6: 'In this dasha the speed limit shows. Results stall until the routine improves. Health, debt, a dispute or a correction at work. Do the daily piece. The denial is not the teaching. The delay is.',
  7: 'In this dasha money, partnership and pleasure are active. Benefics teach finance gently. Malefics teach it from the bottom. A cheat on the partner shows as a leak at work. A cheat with money shows as a fight at home. Adorn the planet\'s deity. Stay loyal.',
  8: 'Dasha of a planet in Scorpio navamsha: what you most fear in that planet\'s domain tends to arrive. First dampness and stuckness — no oxygen, no easy exit — then profound transformation. Childhood spark and soft emotion thin out. Agenda and core nature change by the end. Do not look back into old Libra comfort; do not feed negativity (it magnets). Forgive, forget, move on. Seek a Sagittarius guide who has already walked the path. Plane change / sadhana camp helps when activated; Vipassana alone can deepen the pit — bhakti and company of devotees lift better.',
  9: 'Dasha of a planet in Sagittarius navamsha: principles and fortune are tested on the ridge. Keep morals high; a regulatory or sexual slip can cost the chair (fall from height). Stay mute — big goals, not twenty-rupee fights. Hidden protection from guru and father if you refuse the temptation that calls. Refill punya with nama, charity and Vishnu-tattva worship; release Scorpio grudges so this sign can open. Three–four months\' savings while it runs. After ~25 / marriage the D9 reading outweighs early D1-ninth guru traits.',
  10: 'Dasha of a planet in Capricorn navamsha: bonded labour in that planet\'s domain. Pressure-cooker, manual grind, isolation on work nobody else knows. No mood excuse — opposite Cancer. Authority, money and status can come after the scrape; happiness and soft honour stay thin (Jupiter debilitated). Do not play victim. Burn through work and small bhakti; mark boundaries so home is not unpaid office. Strong dignity commands; weak dignity gasps.',
  11: 'Dasha of a planet in Aquarius navamsha: the area first stalls, then delivers in chunks through past punya, networks and back-doors — VIP line, not the queue. Rules bend; paperwork thins; social media and artificial light activate. Desire fulfilment demands dropped grief and controlled obsession; waste the merit on hype, EMI or anti-authority and Capricorn bondage follows. Store monsoon money. Refill with social service; Ma Durga / Varaha / Chaitanya hold the key.',
  12: 'Dasha of a planet in Pisces navamsha: liberation from that planet\'s bindings — or sleepless debt if punya is thin. Human support withdraws so feet and God remain; false bonds and fraud dissolve. Mercury calculation fails; Venus turns to devotion. Eighth-from-Leo drops of chair, leave and transfer. Give to the universe (dan); do not read the past backward. Libra periods inside this sign are the harshest fork. Rain of grace when the subconscious is clean; Capricorn if Aquarius bhoga was not released.',
}

